      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Marcus and Andre definitely lean toward common crime thriller archetypes, while Julian and Elena fit comfortably into high-society dramas. Kenji and Arthur could work in either genre depending on their motivations, but Julian's ingrained old money vibe is very prestige. To make them less trope-y, try giving Marcus or Andre a surprising vulnerability, or give Julian a secret ethical flaw. For genre placement: Marcus/Andre for Crime Drama, Julian/Elena/Arthur for Prestige Drama, and Kenji is versatile.",
